   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fattigdomsminskning genom h&#xe5;llbart f&#xf6;retagande - FJ Lastvagnar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FJ Group was established in Russia with the aim of becoming the leading supplier of high quality components for truck manufacturers with local assembly plants. The company leveraged its expertise in designing and manufacturing auto components and successfully established its Russian operations in 2008. FJ Group aims to expand its production capacity and broaden its product offering.</narrative>
